spacenavd (free driver for 3Dconnexion 6DoF devices)

spacenavd is a daemon that enables 3Dconnexion SpaceMouse and SpaceNavigator
devices under Linux.

To start the daemon on boot, add the following to /etc/rc.d/rc.local:
  if [ -x /etc/rc.d/rc.spacenavd ]; then
    /etc/rc.d/rc.spacenavd start
  fi
